{"id":2450,"date":"2023-07-23T13:07:00","date_gmt":"2023-07-23T11:07:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/?page_id=2450"},"modified":"2026-08-24T15:15:02","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T13:15:02","slug":"privat-selskap","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/privat-selskap\/","title":{"rendered":"Privat Selskap"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"2450\" class=\"elementor elementor-2450\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-67885ea elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"67885ea\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8c04693\" data-id=\"8c04693\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f032212 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"f032212\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<section class=\"pf-arriba\" style=\"background-color:#0a0a0a; overflow:hidden;\">\r\n\r\n  <!-- HEADER: editorial split - portret slika + tekst panel -->\r\n  <div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap-reverse; min-height:640px;\">\r\n    <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:320px; background-color:#141414; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:90px 55px;\">\r\n      <div style=\"max-width:420px;\">\r\n        <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:5px; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0 0 22px;\">Arriba<\/p>\r\n        <h2 style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:34px; font-weight:500; line-height:1.35; margin:0 0 28px;\">Ditt private sted for spesielle anledninger<\/h2>\r\n        <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; line-height:1.9; opacity:0.82; margin:0 0 20px;\">\r\n          Porfavor Arriba er en sala privada som p\u00e5 spansk betyr privat stue, tilbyr vi gjestene en privat spiseopplevelse ideell for feiringer, kurs eller forretningsmiddager. Porfavor Arriba gir muligheten til \u00e5 nyte h\u00f8y kvalitet tapas og service i et mer personlig og avslappet milj\u00f8. Arriba er tilgjengelig for b\u00e5de sm\u00e5 og store selskap p\u00e5 opptil 22 personer.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n        <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; line-height:1.9; opacity:0.82; margin:0 0 20px;\">\r\n          Crianza Beverage Group arrangerer Winemaker's Dinners i samarbeid med vinprodusenter og ving\u00e5rder som vinene importeres i fra. Vinkurs og WineMaker's dinners holdes p\u00e5 PorFavor Arriba.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n        <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; line-height:1.9; opacity:0.82; margin:0 0 6px;\">Kontakt oss for reservasjon.<\/p>\r\n        <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:17px; font-style:italic; margin:0 0 34px;\">Velkommen til Arriba!<\/p>\r\n\r\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/contact\/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#0a0a0a; background-color:#bc906b; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; text-decoration:none; padding:16px 34px;\">Kontakt<\/a>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:320px; min-height:480px; background-image:url('https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/09.32.54_41f16819.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center;\"><\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- SHARING EXPERIENCE INTRO -->\r\n  <div style=\"position:relative; padding:110px 20px 70px;\">\r\n    <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; background-image:linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a0a 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 60%, #0a0a0a 100%), url('http:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/flavour_bg.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; filter:grayscale(15%);\"><\/div>\r\n    <div style=\"position:relative; max-width:680px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;\">\r\n      <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:5px; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0 0 20px;\">Arriba<\/p>\r\n      <h3 style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:34px; font-weight:500; line-height:1.35; margin:0 0 16px;\">PorFavor Sharing Experience<\/h3>\r\n      <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:16px; font-style:italic; margin:0 0 26px;\">En opplevelse skapt for \u00e5 deles.<\/p>\r\n      <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; line-height:1.9; opacity:0.85; margin:0;\">\r\n        V\u00e5r Sharing Experience er satt sammen av kj\u00f8kkensjefens signaturserveringer, skapt for \u00e5 deles rundt bordet \u2013 der uts\u00f8kte smaker, n\u00f8ye utvalgte viner og ekte gjestfrihet m\u00f8tes.\r\n      <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- SHARING EXPERIENCE - prisniv\u00e5er -->\r\n  <div style=\"position:relative; padding:20px 20px 90px; text-align:center;\">\r\n    <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; background-image:url('https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/PorFavor-Tapas48401-scaled.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; filter:blur(7px) brightness(0.22) saturate(1.1); transform:scale(1.08);\"><\/div>\r\n    <div style=\"position:relative; max-width:640px; margin:0 auto;\">\r\n      <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:5px; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0 0 40px;\">Sharing Experience<\/p>\r\n      <div>\r\n        <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; padding:18px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(188,144,107,0.3);\">\r\n          <span style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:18px; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">6 serveringer<\/span>\r\n          <span style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:16px;\">695 NOK per person<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; padding:18px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(188,144,107,0.3);\">\r\n          <span style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:18px; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">7 serveringer<\/span>\r\n          <span style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:16px;\">795 NOK per person<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; padding:18px 0;\">\r\n          <span style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:18px; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">8 serveringer<\/span>\r\n          <span style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:16px;\">895 NOK per person<\/span>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <a href=\"http:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Sharing-menu.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" download style=\"display:inline-block; margin-top:36px; color:#bc906b; background-color:transparent; border:1px solid #bc906b; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; text-decoration:none; padding:15px 32px; transition:background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;\">Last ned meny (PDF)<\/a>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- FULLFOR OPPLEVELSEN + CHAMBRE SEPAREE: glass panel preko slike -->\r\n  <div style=\"position:relative; min-height:480px; display:flex; align-items:center;\">\r\n    <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; background-image:url('http:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/image001.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; filter:grayscale(20%) brightness(0.5);\"><\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div style=\"position:relative; margin:70px auto; width:min(820px, 90%); background:rgba(12,12,12,0.5); backdrop-filter:blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px); border:1px solid rgba(188,144,107,0.45); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.55); padding:55px 45px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:50px;\">\r\n\r\n      <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:240px; text-align:center;\">\r\n        <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:4px; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0 0 22px;\">Fullf\u00f8r opplevelsen<\/p>\r\n        <div style=\"display:grid; gap:14px;\">\r\n          <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between;\">\r\n            <span style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:15px;\">Dessert<\/span>\r\n            <span style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:15px;\">165 NOK<\/span>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between;\">\r\n            <span style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:15px;\">Kaffe &amp; Avec<\/span>\r\n            <span style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:15px;\">145 NOK<\/span>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n          <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between;\">\r\n            <span style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:15px;\">Velkomstaperitiff<\/span>\r\n            <span style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:15px;\">165 NOK<\/span>\r\n          <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:240px; text-align:center; border-top:1px solid rgba(188,144,107,0.3); padding-top:26px; align-self:center;\">\r\n        <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:4px; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0 0 16px;\">Chambre S\u00e9par\u00e9e<\/p>\r\n        <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; line-height:1.8; opacity:0.82; margin:0 0 18px;\">\r\n          For selskaper som \u00f8nsker en mer privat ramme, tilbyr v\u00e5rt Chambre S\u00e9par\u00e9e et elegant privat selskapsrom med egen vert gjennom hele kvelden.\r\n        <\/p>\r\n        <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:15px; margin:0 0 6px;\">Eksklusivt Chambre S\u00e9par\u00e9e<\/p>\r\n        <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:19px; margin:0;\">5.000 NOK<\/p>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- VINPAKKER -->\r\n  <div style=\"position:relative; padding:100px 20px; text-align:center;\">\r\n    <div style=\"position:absolute; inset:0; background-image:url('https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/18824237-scaled.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; filter:blur(8px) brightness(0.2); transform:scale(1.1);\"><\/div>\r\n    <div style=\"position:relative; max-width:680px; margin:0 auto;\">\r\n      <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:5px; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0 0 20px;\">Vinpakker<\/p>\r\n      <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; line-height:1.9; opacity:0.85; margin:0 0 50px;\">\r\n        V\u00e5re vinpakker er n\u00f8ye kuratert av v\u00e5r sommelier for \u00e5 f\u00f8lge menyen gjennom hele m\u00e5ltidet og fremheve hver enkelt servering.\r\n      <\/p>\r\n\r\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center; gap:1px; background:rgba(188,144,107,0.3); margin-bottom:45px;\">\r\n        <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:280px; background:#0a0a0a; padding:36px 34px; text-align:left;\">\r\n          <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:19px; font-weight:500; margin:0 0 12px;\">Standard vinpakke<\/p>\r\n          <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; opacity:0.75; margin:0 0 18px;\">Tre n\u00f8ye utvalgte viner \u2013 musserende, hvitvin og r\u00f8dvin.<\/p>\r\n          <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:17px; margin:0;\">450 NOK<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:280px; background:#0a0a0a; padding:36px 34px; text-align:left;\">\r\n          <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:19px; font-weight:500; margin:0 0 12px;\">Premium vinpakke<\/p>\r\n          <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; opacity:0.75; margin:0 0 18px;\">Fire eksepsjonelle viner, avsluttet med en dessertvin fra v\u00e5r vinkjeller.<\/p>\r\n          <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:17px; margin:0;\">750 NOK<\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n\r\n      <p style=\"color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; line-height:1.85; opacity:0.65; font-style:italic; margin:0;\">\r\n        For den mest helhetlige matopplevelsen anbefaler vi en av v\u00e5re n\u00f8ye sammensatte vinpakker. Hver vin er valgt for \u00e5 f\u00f8lge menyens utvikling gjennom kvelden og skape en harmonisk helhet \u2013 samtidig som vinpakken gir en mer fordelaktig opplevelse enn \u00e5 velge vin per glass.\r\n      <\/p>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- RAZDJELNIK -->\r\n  <div style=\"position:relative; height:180px; background-image:url('https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/PorFavor-Tapas48398-scaled.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; filter:blur(3px) grayscale(30%) brightness(0.5);\"><\/div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- ARRIBA GALLERI -->\r\n  <div style=\"padding:60px 0 10px;\">\r\n    <p style=\"color:#bc906b; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:5px; text-transform:uppercase; text-align:center; margin:0 0 40px;\">Arriba Galleri<\/p>\r\n\r\n    <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 1fr); gap:2px;\">\r\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Arriba-porfavor.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block; aspect-ratio:1; background-image:url('https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Arriba-porfavor.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; filter:grayscale(25%); transition:filter 0.3s;\"><\/a>\r\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/PorFavor-Arriba.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block; aspect-ratio:1; background-image:url('https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/PorFavor-Arriba.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; filter:grayscale(25%); transition:filter 0.3s;\"><\/a>\r\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/Ariba-table.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block; aspect-ratio:1; background-image:url('https:\/\/askerporfavor.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/0